{"t":"EIX","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Edison International","ko":null,"sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","employees":13725,"hq":"Rosemead, CA, United States","website":"https://www.edison.com","summary_en":"Edison International, through its subsidiaries, engages in the generation and distribution of electric power. The company supplies and delivers through its electrical infrastructure to an approximately 50,000 square-mile area of southern, central, and coastal California. It serves residential, commercial, industrial, public authorities, agricultural, street lighting, and other sectors. The company's distribution network consists of approximately 13,000 circuit-miles of lines ranging from 55 kV to 500 kV and approximately 80 transmission substations; and approximately 38,000 circuit-miles of overhead lines, approximately 32,000 circuit-miles of underground lines, and approximately 730 distribution substations. Edison International was founded in 1886 and is based in Rosemead, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Edison International은 자회사를 통해 전력 생산 및 유통에 종사하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 전기 인프라를 통해 캘리포니아 남부, 중부 및 해안의 약 50,000평방마일에 달하는 지역에 공급하고 배송합니다. 주거, 상업, 산업, 공공 기관, 농업, 가로등 및 기타 분야에 서비스를 제공합니다. 회사의 배전망은 55kV ~ 500kV 범위의 약 13,000 회로 마일과 약 80개의 변전소로 구성됩니다. 가공선은 약 38,000 회로 마일, 지하철 노선은 약 32,000 회로 마일, 배전 변전소는 약 730개입니다. Edison International은 1886년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 로즈미드에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":60.88,"mcap":23425847296.0,"pe":6.469713,"fpe":9.355977,"peg":2.7316,"ps":1.2622365,"pb":1.3156132,"ev_ebitda":8.359,"div":5.77,"beta":0.551,"hi52":81.62,"lo52":51.1},"fin":{"rev":18559000576.0,"rev_g":-0.15,"eps_g":-0.134,"gross":0.59443,"op":0.21531,"net":0.19597,"roe":0.18756,"fcf":-176124992.0,"cash":171000000.0,"debt":42714001408.0,"de":219.575,"eps":9.41,"feps":6.50707},"own":{"short":0.0638,"inst":0.97253,"insider":0.00262},"analyst":{"n":15,"mean":63.03333,"median":62.0,"high":86.0,"low":42.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":3.17647,"trend":[{